---
layout: base.njk
title: Articles
description: "Practical writing on anxiety, trauma, burnout, men's mental health, and what therapy actually looks like. By David Robles, LMSW."
permalink: /blog/
---
<header class="article-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Articles</h1>
    <p class="deck">Practical writing on anxiety, trauma, burnout, and what therapy actually looks like.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="article-body">
  <ul class="post-list">
    {%- for post in collections.blog | reverse %}
    <li class="post-card">
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">
        {% if post.data.tag %}<span class="tag">{{ post.data.tag }}</span>{% endif %}
        <h2>{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        <span class="article-date" style="color: var(--muted);">{{ post.date | readableDate }}{% if post.data.readTime %} &middot; {{ post.data.readTime }}{% endif %}</span>
      </a>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</main>
